      en: ["Area: approximately 150,000 km²", "Average elevation: 50 m", "Length of Euphrates in area: 1,000 km", "Annual rice field area: 10,000 km²", "Number of archaeological sites: over 500", "Salinization rate: 30% of agricultural land"],
